	(text "Amplifier output V/I monitor: ACS37800 (SPI) on an isolated 5 V domain from the ISOW7741 (110 mA max at 5 V to 5 V; VSEL on VISOOUT selects 5 V). Beads on VISOOUT-VISOIN and GND2-GISOIN follow the ISOW774x datasheet for emissions."
